      "cooked": "<p>Okay, I was discussing this with friends IRL, but I figure I’ll put this out to the world. Let’s say SotM got a DCAU style cartoon.</p>\n<p>Now, at the first, we need the appropriate voices for everyone, so I ask you, who is going to voice our favorite heroes and villains?</p>\n<p>Now, the first thing we figured was that Steve Blum had to be Absolute Zero. He just has the right snarky voice to fit Absolute Zero. We were all agreed.</p>\n<p>Apart from that, we couldn’t come to a single concensus on the other heroes and villains the night we discussed it. So who would you all pick for Absolute and the rest?</p>",
